{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ynopsis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Yoi, receives a letter from his dead sister, Chitose, saying that she wants to tell him a secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to find out the truth, Yoyi heads to an abandoned laboratory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outline </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D exploration adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While being chased by mysterious characters, the player must guide the two characters and use items to solve gimmicks and reach the location written in the letter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of the Demo Version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlay approximately 30 minutes of content, equivalent to about 1/4 of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb2D exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSet in a modern abandoned hospital rendered in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFeatures original game soundtrack compositions.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999900?t=1757522770","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999900?t=1757522770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999900/a0ea66864030cdfae4f688d2063320cef18844cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757522770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999900/a0ea66864030cdfae4f688d2063320cef18844cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757522770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ynopsis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Yoi, receives a letter from his dead sister, Chitose, saying that she wants to tell him a secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragrap